    "text": "By Mackenzie Baker ,\n16 hours ago SAVANNAH, Ga. (WTOC) - A local organization is bringing the conversation on data centers into the spotlight. Savannah Indivisible is hosting a town hall Wednesday to discuss details on data center development and if the Hostess City is prepared for these facilities. Data centers are popping up across the country... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
